# Go 1.26.0 SDUI BFF Rules

- Consult `skills/abeta-kmp-bff/SKILL.md` and `agents/owners/bff-owner.md`.
- Maintain strict Clean Architecture (`internal/handler -> internal/usecase -> internal/domain <- internal/infra`; `domain` has zero Gin/`net/http` imports).
- Keep 1:1 wire parity with `kmp/sdui-contracts` and `kmp/action-engine` (`29` wire atoms, `23` snippets incl. `composed_block` w/ `36` `ComposedNodeKind`s, `custom_slot`, & `graph_canvas`, `6` `SnippetDeltaOp`s, `18` actions) across the 8 exportable `pkg/sdui/*` packages (`bff@v0.9.0`), and keep all **11** golden fixtures in `bff/testdata/golden/` passing.
